# Preview Pane Width Persistence Implementation
# 
# This diff contains the implementation for persisting preview pane width across sessions.
# It was temporarily rolled back because it requires system-wide installation of the
# GSettings schema to work properly. When the schema is installed system-wide, this
# diff can be applied to enable width persistence.
# 
# Features implemented:
# - GSettings key "preview-pane-width" with 350px default
# - Size-allocate callback for tracking width changes  
# - Automatic save/restore of user's preferred pane width
# - Proper cleanup of handler IDs on window disposal
#
# To apply: 
# 1. Install schema system-wide (e.g. via package installation)
# 2. Apply this diff with: git apply preview-pane-persistence.diff
# 3. Rebuild and test

